  "s1": {
   "speaker": "rinne",
   "name": "凛音",
   "color": "vermilion_500",
   "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
   "side": "left",
   "text": "（引路词）魂兮归来，莫恋此乡。灯前有路，路尽有光——去吧。",
